Several versions of D&D have barbarian as the berserker class.  1e (in
Unearthed Arcana), 2e (Fighters Handbook), 3e (the entire thing), all
had 'Barbarian' guys who could berserk/rage/whatever.  It's not a bad
meme to work on, I guess.


